{ <last_idx> is read in the initializer of its own declaration. The helper writes to its
  parameter, so it is not an expression function and ASTReturnFunctionRewriting splits the
  declaration - which is what used to make the compiler accept this while the server, which
  checks before any rewriting, reported the name as undeclared. }
function bump(value) -> result
	result := value + 1
	value := result
end function

on note
	declare <|declared_name|>last_idx := bump(last_idx)
	message(last_idx)
end on
